# Assayline — .codegen must not reach GitHub

**.codegen should never be pushed to GitHub**

- Do not stage or commit `.codegen/`, `codegen/`, or `**/zero_codegen/`
- Keep `package_scope` as `@assayline` in local codegen config only
- If missing locally, rsync from `zero-apps-codegen-scaffold` — still do not push
